{"metadata":{"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"意象理论","text":"意象理论"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"同伦维数 (意象)"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"同伦维数"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal X$ 与 $n\\geq -1$, 若 $\\mathcal X$ 中每个 $(n-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":"对象 $A$ 都有整体元素 $1\\to A$, 则称 $\\mathcal X$ 的<strong>同伦维数</strong> $\\leq n$.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>同伦维数 $\\leq (-1)$ 的意象只有"},{"Local":{"url":"空意象","text":"空意象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":" 的同伦维数为 $0$, 因为其中的 $(-1)$-连通对象为非空生象, 而非空生象总有点.</p>\n"}]}}